BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 271.00 Tm (Important Constraints Going Forward) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 248.00 Tm (- Do not reintroduce low-opacity rectangular backgrounds into transparent PNG assets. Transparent areas) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 236.00 Tm (  should be alpha 0 unless they are actual shard/tile silhouettes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 224.00 Tm (- Do not make Home/About mosaic additions from stock-like or object-filled imagery. The extension areas) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 212.00 Tm (  should remain shard/tile fields that support the original subject.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 200.00 Tm (- Do not overwrite approved square sources when making tall both-side variants. New generated or processed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 188.00 Tm (  assets should be saved as sibling files with clear names.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 176.00 Tm (- Do not assume pressing a in Expo is the normal path for the S21 FE Expo Go workflow. Use manual Expo Go) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 164.00 Tm (  URL entry or QR/tunnel unless intentionally launching an emulator or USB-connected Android device.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 152.00 Tm (- Do not treat Android native system navigation-bar color as a web-visible feature. Validate it on Expo Go or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 140.00 Tm (  Android directly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 128.00 Tm (- Do not let header chevrons become gray again through opacity-state combinations; when shown together, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 116.00 Tm (  desired visual target is black.) Tj ET
