BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 677.00 Tm (- For additional mosaic assets, start with an AI/image-generation pass only for the square subject when the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 665.00 Tm (  subject needs visual understanding; use deterministic local processing for alpha cleanup, canvas extension,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 653.00 Tm (  sizing, and file placement.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 641.00 Tm (- If a generated result is close, iterate by changing one visual axis at a time: grain, color, tile size, density, edge) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 629.00 Tm (  blend, or subject readability. Avoid changing all of them at once.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 617.00 Tm (- For Expo Go problems, avoid recloning unless Git state is truly corrupt. Most failures are stale Metro, stale) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 605.00 Tm (  tunnel, wrong URL, phone cache, or local network reachability.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 593.00 Tm (- After any image or native chrome change, test on the actual Android phone because web can hide both) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 581.00 Tm (  alpha-composite perception and native navigation-bar behavior.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 557.00 Tm (Closing Summary) Tj ET
